OL,3,GNEWSASchool's no touching rule to be
OL,4,Areviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school which has been criticised by
OL,7,Fparents for bringing in a "no physical
OL,8,Fcontact" rule has said it will be
OL,9,Freviewing the approach.
OL,11,FParents claim some pupils at Philip
OL,12,FMorant School in Colchester have been
OL,13,Fgiven detentions for hugging or
OL,14,Fhigh-fiving their friends since the new
OL,15,Fguidance was brought in at the start of
OL,16,Fterm.
OL,18,FThe author of an online petition raised
OL,19,Fconcerns that "normal, consensual
OL,20,Fphysical interaction" had been removed,
OL,21,Fand there was an impact on their
OL,22,Femotional wellbeing.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
